# PHP Theme Conventions

- File header docblock with `@package Rich_And_Well`
- `if ( ! defined( 'ABSPATH' ) ) { exit; }` in includable files
- Tabs for indentation (WPCS)
- Prefer readable WordPress-style conditionals
- Hooks: document callbacks; remove actions carefully with matching priority
- Use `get_template_directory()` / `get_template_directory_uri()` via `RAW_THEME_*` constants
- Template tags that print must escape; helpers that return data clearly named (`raw_get_*` vs `raw_the_*`)
- No business/MLM logic in theme templates
